summary: lm_sensors smoke test
description: |
  This is just a basic lm_sensors smoke test which checks whether
  some sensors are detected and their values reported.

  It backs up lm_sensors config files and restores them when it's
contact: Laura Trivelloni <ltrivell@redhat.com>
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
require:
  - lm_sensors
adjust:
  - enabled: false
    when: arch == aarch64
duration: 5m
extra-task: /kernel/lm_sensors/Sanity/smoke
